event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dispatch_dev_1.md\", \"content\": \"Task: implement the \\\"greet, tested\\\" mission in the subject repository.\\n\\nRequirements (all must be met):\\n\\n1. Create `src/greet.py` containing a function `greet(name)` that returns the\\n   string `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (e.g. `greet(\\\"World\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, World!\\\"`).\\n2. Create `tests/test_greet.py` with unit tests covering at least:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. \\\"World\\\" or similar)\\n   - the empty string `\\\"\\\"` as the name\\n3. Verify locally that `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits with\\n   status 0 (all tests pass).\\n4. Commit all changes to your own branch.\\n5. Reply with an honest report: what you implemented, the exact output of the\\n   test run (including the exit code), and confirm the commit is on your\\n   branch. If anything does not pass, say so plainly rather than omitting it.\\n\\nDo not touch any files outside `src/` and `tests/` unless strictly necessary.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

